'''Summer Break Cats Paradise''' (ねこのなつやすみ パラダイス編, ''Neko no Natsuyasumi Paradaisuhen'', '''Summer Break Cats Paradise''') is the first part of the trilogy Summer event in [[The Battle Cats]], the second part being [[Summer Break Cats Castaway]] and the third part being [[Summer Break Cats]]. Added in [[Version 14.6 Update|Version 14.6]].

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Summer Break Cats: Paradise on now!'''}}

Summer, the sea, and a resort!<br>
Limited summer event, Summer Break Cats: Paradise on now!

{{Color|#EA4335|'''On from August 7th (11:00 am) until August 28th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●Use Cat Scratcher Cards for a chance at free Cat Food every week!'''}}<br>
Win a bonus prize of Cat Food each week from the Cat Scratcher! Just tap one of the three circles and wait for your prize to be revealed!

Make one scratch during each time period listed below!

{{Color|#EA4335|'''Chance #1: August 7th (11:00 am) until August 13th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#EA4335|'''Chance #2: August 14th (11:00 am) until August 20th (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#EA4335|'''Chance #3: August 21st (11:00 am) until August 28th (10:59am)'''}}

Be sure to claim all three chances for a maximum possible total of {{Color|#4A86E8|'''450 Cat Food'''}} in prizes!<br>
Try your luck and get that sweet, sweet Cat Food!

{{Color|#EA4335|'''Summer Break Cats: Paradise Event Capsules!'''}}<br>
Draw from the Event Capsules using {{Color|#FF9900|'''Legendary Banknotes'''}}!<br>
Collect {{Color|#9900FF|'''NEW'''}} Special Unit {{Color|#9900FF|'''Ancient Egg: N207'''}}!

{{Color|#34A853|'''Rewards: 4 limited units, XP, battle items, and more!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> The Event Capsules can only be used with Event Tickets earned in-game.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Event Capsules will be unavailable after the event ends, and Event Tickets will be unusable.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Unused Event Tickets cannot be converted into items or XP.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Summer Break Cats: Paradise limited stages on now!'''}}<br>
Enjoy a chill holiday with limited paradise stages!

Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages during this event to test your Cats in these limited stages!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Gauntlet Map - "Summer Break Cats: Paradise" on now!'''}}<br>
Develop the resort and collect {{Color|#34A853|'''Legendary Banknotes'''}} after clearing stages!<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Legendary Banknote'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Once all stage attempts have been used, you will be able to retry after a certain amount of time has passed.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Cooldown times can be skipped by using a Catamin A item.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''New Map: "Billionaire's Bidding"!'''}}<br>
A new challenge featuring a set of special challenge rules!<br>
Start the stages with 1,000,000¢, but watch out! Operating costs soon skyrocket as deploy costs increase each time you send out a unit!<br>
Use your huge windfall to win the auction!

{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Legendary Banknote'''}}

{{Color|#EA4335|'''<nowiki>*</nowiki> Some CatCombos may not take effect depending on the current event rules. Please note that the following effects will not be activated even if the required units for a CatCombo are placed in the formation:'''}}<br>
{{Color|#EA4335|'''Starting Money Up, Worker Max Up, Worker Start Level Up, Bounty Up'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This map can only be cleared once per day.

{{Color|#980000|'''・Jackpot Junction available from week 2 of the event!'''}}<br>
Use Legendary Banknotes for a chance at earning even MORE Legendary Banknotes!<br>
Sure, luck won't always be on your side... But the gamble might just be worth it!

{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Legendary Banknote'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 14th (11:00 am) until August 28th (10:59am)!'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> This map consumes Legendary Banknotes instead of energy.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> This map can only be cleared five times in one day.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Starting Week 2: Extravagant Resort Land'''}}<br>
A private beach, all to yourself!

{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Cat Ticket, Legendary Banknote, Battle Items, and more!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 14th (11:00 am) until August 28th (10:59am)!'''}}<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Tap the Timed Score button at the bottom left of the Map menu to check available rewards.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Starting Week 3: Sauna of Paradise'''}}<br>
Can you endure this high-stakes battle?<br>
Clear this map to earn Lucky Tickets to collect a limited Special unit! Use the Lucky Tickets by selecting the Lucky Capsules tab at the Cat Capsules in the Cat Base!
{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Lucky Ticket'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On from August 21st (11:00 am) until August 28th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#CC4125|'''・Limited Missions and login stamps!'''}}

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''"Summer Break Cats: Paradise" Special Missions'''}}<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Legendary Banknote, Behemoth Stones (Red, Purple)'''}}

{{Color|#4A86E8|'''Collect up to 21 "Summer Break Cats: Paradise" Login Stamps'''}}<br>
{{Color|#34A853|'''Reward(s): Legendary Banknote, Rare Ticket, Cat Ticket'''}}

<nowiki>*</nowiki> You must claim rewards from cleared Special missions before the event ends. Even if mission objectives have been met, rewards cannot be claimed after the mission disappears.<br>
<nowiki>*</nowiki> Some Missions are only available after clearing Empire of Cats Ch. 3.

